### Why is the CRM showing no results? {slug: crm/faq/why-is-the-crm-showing-no-results}
Get here: "CRM"
Check workspace (click workspace name, switch); CRM is per-workspace. New workspaces start empty; data comes from campaigns, manual add, CSV import, or calendar sync. Campaigns take 15-60 min provisioning, replies in 3-7 days. Import via "People" > "Import People". If CRM missing, ask admin to check "Settings" > "Members"; clear filters if stuck.

