### Offer Creator {slug: offer-creator}
Get here: In the left sidebar, click "Offer Creator"
- Turns experience, skills, and network into service offer packages, usable in sales/marketing.
- Two tabs: "Manual Input" (2-step form, 8 optional fields on results, skills, systems, industry knowledge, network, validation, clients, credibility) or "From Transcript" (upload call recording MP3/WAV/M4A/AAC/OGG up to 250MB, or paste transcript).
