### Growth Plan Creator {slug: growth-plan-creator}
Get here: In the left sidebar, click "Growth Plan Creator"
- 6-step form: Your Info/Prospect Basics, Discovery Call Transcript (optional, 1000+ chars, add "Rep:"/"Prospect:" labels), Business Context, Goals and Challenges, Services and Solutions, Review and Submit.
- Must check confirmation box before "Submit Growth Plan" is enabled.
- Generation takes 5-10 minutes; email sent when ready; runs in background.
- Output sections: State of Markets, Market Gap, Four Pillars, Projected Outcomes, Advantages, Investment Options (2-3 pricing packages), Next Steps.
- Past plans: scroll to History table below the form, click a row to open.
- Fixes: transcript rejected (clean formatting, add labels, 1000+ chars); stuck >15 min, resubmit; submit button off, check box and required fields (*).

### Frequently Asked Questions {slug: growth-plan-creator/faq}
Get here: not stated

### Can I add my logo to the plan? {slug: growth-plan-creator/faq/can-i-add-my-logo-to-the-plan}
Not supported. Copy content into your own branded Word/Google Docs template.

### Can I create a plan from a sales call analysis? {slug: growth-plan-creator/faq/can-i-create-a-plan-from-a-sales-call-analysis}
Yes. On the call detail page, click "Generate Growth Plan" in the Actions menu; pre-fills the form.

### Can I export to Word or PDF? {slug: growth-plan-creator/faq/can-i-export-to-word-or-pdf}
Export is limited/basic. Copy content into Word or Google Docs manually.

### Do I need a discovery call transcript? {slug: growth-plan-creator/faq/do-i-need-a-discovery-call-transcript}
No, optional; pick "No" in Step 2 to fill in manually.

### Does my progress get saved if I leave? {slug: growth-plan-creator/faq/does-my-progress-get-saved-if-i-leave}
Yes, autosaved per workspace.

### How do I translate the Growth Plan for non-technical clients? {slug: growth-plan-creator/faq/how-do-i-translate-the-growth-plan-for-non-technical-clients}
Lead with outcomes not tactics, translate jargon, use Pricing Calculator for dollar figures, frame as a conversation.

### How long does it take to generate? {slug: growth-plan-creator/faq/how-long-does-it-take-to-generate}
Same as growth-plan-creator.

### The Growth Plan Creator could not save progress? {slug: growth-plan-creator/faq/the-growth-plan-creator-could-not-save-progress}
Saves to browser local storage; if blocked, error shown.
Fixes: clear cache/cookies, avoid incognito, enable cookies/local storage, disable privacy extensions, try another browser, else report via "Feedback" in account menu (click name at bottom of sidebar) with error and browsers tried.

### The Growth Plan Creator retains info from a previous client? {slug: growth-plan-creator/faq/the-growth-plan-creator-retains-info-from-a-previous-client}
Autosave carries old answers. Fix: open wizard, click "Reset Form", confirm. Cannot be undone; saved history plans unaffected.

### The Growth Plan Creator shows an Application Error? {slug: growth-plan-creator/faq/the-growth-plan-creator-shows-an-application-error}
Usually transient; plan may still be in History. Refresh, check History table, resubmit, try incognito. After 2-3 fails, report via "Feedback" in account menu with offer/niche, error message, whether plan appears in history.

### The Growth Plan doesn't account for my client's budget? {slug: growth-plan-creator/faq/the-growth-plan-doesnt-account-for-my-clients-budget}
AI optimizes for growth potential, ignores entered budget. Manually adjust: keep 2-3 high-ROI items fitting budget, note 1-2 upsell items, use Pricing Calculator to show ROI.

### What are the key deliverable options? {slug: growth-plan-creator/faq/what-are-the-key-deliverable-options}
Step 5 checklist: lead generation systems, automation, content strategy, paid advertising, sales funnels, "Other" (type own).

### What are the urgency driver options? {slug: growth-plan-creator/faq/what-are-the-urgency-driver-options}
Step 4 checklist: revenue declining, competitors growing, deadline approaching, lost a key client, new regulations, "Other".

### What does Growth Plan Creator do? {slug: growth-plan-creator/faq/what-does-growth-plan-creator-do}
Same as growth-plan-creator.

### What if I do not have a recording? {slug: growth-plan-creator/faq/what-if-i-do-not-have-a-recording}
Pick "No" in Step 2, fill Steps 3-5 manually; plan quality depends on detail given.

### What sections are in the growth plan? {slug: growth-plan-creator/faq/what-sections-are-in-the-growth-plan}
Same sections as growth-plan-creator; also includes metadata of generation date and whether a transcript was used.

