### How do I connect an IONOS domain? {slug: white-label-partners/faq/domain-providers/how-do-i-connect-an-ionos-domain}
Get here: not stated
In IONOS: "Domains & SSL" > domain > "DNS" > "Add record". Copy Type/Name/Value from "Partner Panel" > "Domains"; paste into IONOS. Repeat all records, then "Verify Domain". Keep MX/SPF/DKIM/DMARC intact. Use short host if subdomain.

