Get here: not stated
Wix: "Domains" > domain > "DNS Records" > add record matching Partner Panel Type/Name/Value. Repeat, then "Verify Domain". If root domain hosts site, use a subdomain. If uneditable, DNS may be elsewhere.

### How do I connect a Shopify domain? {slug: white-label-partners/faq/domain-providers/how-do-i-connect-a-shopify-domain}
Get here: not stated
Shopify: "Settings" > "Domains" > domain > "DNS settings" > "Add custom record". Match Partner Panel Type/Name/Value. Use separate subdomain, not store's existing records. Then "Verify Domain" in Partner Panel.

### How do I connect a Hover domain? {slug: white-label-partners/faq/domain-providers/how-do-i-connect-a-hover-domain}
Get here: not stated
Hover: domain overview > "DNS" > "Add a record", matching Partner Panel Type/Hostname/Value. Repeat all, then "Verify Domain". Check nameservers if DNS managed elsewhere; leave existing records alone.

### Why is my white-label domain not verifying? {slug: white-label-partners/faq/domain-providers/domain-troubleshooting}
Get here: "Partner Panel" > "Domains"
Check spelling, Routing/Verification Records match exactly, click "Verify Domain". DNS may take up to 48 hours. Status shows "Provisioning" then "Active". Use subdomain to protect main site/email. Cloudflare records: set "DNS only" while verifying. Send support: domain, provider, screenshots, error, time changed.

3fa442784e14d310de33f798dcd176f0c83bbeb8:
### When do my credits reset? {slug: workspace-settings/faq/billing-subscriptions/when-do-my-credits-reset}
Get here: Click workspace name > "Settings" > "Billing"
Plan-included credits and one-time topups never reset/expire; unused balance carries forward. Recurring credit packs refill monthly to full amount, don't stack. "Buy More" under "Credit Balances" lets you purchase more. Partner-billed workspaces may offer only one-time or also recurring. Balance shown as single combined number. "Next Billing Date" is renewal date, not credit reset. Only Owners see Billing page.

### Where can I see my subscription end date on the dashboard? {slug: workspace-settings/faq/billing-subscriptions/where-can-i-see-my-subscription-end-date-on-the-dashboard}
Get here: Click workspace name > "Settings" > "Billing"
"Next Billing Date" shown at top = effective end date. "Manage Billing" shows price, charges, payment history, domain/inbox charges. Only Owners can access; Admins, Members, Clients cannot.

### Members & Roles {slug: workspace-settings/faq/members-roles}
Get here: not stated

### How do I activate my main business email for login? {slug: workspace-settings/faq/members-roles/how-do-i-activate-my-main-business-email-for-login-allowed-emails}
Get here: not stated
Allowed Emails approval no longer required. Sign up with desired business email, or use exact invited email. If account exists, use Log in not Sign up. Contact support with old and new email if email changed.

### How do I change my workspace role from Member to Owner? {slug: workspace-settings/faq/members-roles/how-do-i-change-my-workspace-role-from-membereditor-to-owner}
Get here: "Settings" > "Members"
Cannot self-change role; Owner or Admin must change it via role dropdown next to name. Only Owner can grant Owner. Admin can change Admin/Member/Client but not Owner. Workspace needs at least one Owner; demoting last Owner blocked. Change takes effect on next navigation; refresh if needed. If stuck, contact support with workspace name and member email.

### How do I invite an admin member and manage their billing access? {slug: workspace-settings/faq/members-roles/how-do-i-invite-an-admin-member-and-manage-their-billing-access}
Get here: "Settings" > "Members"
Use "Invite Member" card, enter email, select "Admin", click "Send Invite". Only Owners can view/manage Billing; Admins cannot, page won't appear. To let someone manage billing, assign Owner role instead.

### How do I invite team members to my workspace? {slug: workspace-settings/faq/members-roles/how-do-i-invite-team-members-to-my-workspace}
Get here: "Settings" > "Members"
"Invite Member" card: enter email, pick role (Owner, Admin, Member, Client), click "Send Invite". Invitee gets email with Accept button, shows Pending then Active. Only Owners/Admins can invite; one invite at a time; must accept with exact invited email; resending updates role. Client role keeps admin/billing/pricing unavailable; use Partner Panel > Features for client app visibility; don't elevate clients to Member.

### Why can my client workspace member see my personal workspace? {slug: workspace-settings/faq/members-roles/why-can-my-client-workspace-member-see-my-personal-workspace}
Get here: "Settings" > "Members"
Caused by same email added to multiple workspaces. Fix: switch to personal workspace, go to "Settings" > "Members", find member in "Active Members" tab, click three-dot menu, "Remove member", confirm. Use separate emails or aliases to avoid.

